      "width": 2038.4,
      "height": 20.0,
      "text": "Follow one color to tell one story. Arrow labels are story numbers. Each Postgres table says who reads (R), writes (W) or deletes (D) it. Production design; the prototype runs stories 1\u20133 in one process on SQLite, with story 4 as a stretch goal.",
