      "id": "api-l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 634,
      "y": 220.0,
      "width": 416.0,
      "height": 220.0,
      "text": "Chat API \u00b7 LangGraph agent (Cloud Run)\n\nload context (User, Brands, Profile, Persona)\ninput guard + intent router\nretrieve_trios (fixed step)\nReAct: get_schema \u00b7 run_sql (query guard, sqlglot)\nsave_report \u00b7 list_my_reports \u00b7 get_my_report\nplan_deletion \u2192 interrupt() \u2192 execute_deletion\nPersona branch: quality gate \u2192 publish\noutput PII filter (single exit)\ncheckpoint after every node",
      "originalText": "Chat API \u00b7 LangGraph agent (Cloud Run)\n\nload context (User, Brands, Profile, Persona)\ninput guard + intent router\nretrieve_trios (fixed step)\nReAct: get_schema \u00b7 run_sql (query guard, sqlglot)\nsave_report \u00b7 list_my_reports \u00b7 get_my_report\nplan_deletion \u2192 interrupt() \u2192 execute_deletion\nPersona branch: quality gate \u2192 publish\noutput PII filter (single exit)\ncheckpoint after every node",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "api",
      "autoResize": true
    },
